[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0363","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0804","title":"Interactive Story 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Interactive Story 1.3 的 story.pl 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 \"next\" 参数注入 \"..\" 路径遍历序列，突破 Web 根目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞利用条件简单，仅需网络可达即可，无需任何认证凭据，可能导致敏感配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息泄露，影响系统机密性。Interactive Story 1.3 所有安装版本均受此漏洞影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0804"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:59Z","remediation":"修改story.pl脚本，对next参数进行输入校验，过滤包含../序列的请求；在Web服务器层面限制CGI脚本对系统文件的访问权限；禁用或移除story.pl直至厂商发布修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/683","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/4.3.2.7.2.20010715184257.00b20100%40compumodel.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3028","http://www.valeriemates.com/story_download.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6843","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21008","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/98f5df8bf40c6af0934fb1e8baa83eb4ebb7d422/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0804.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0804","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0804.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b6371c93c0d252fc2d75ba4c6c31826fcf2f434e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0804.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/story.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b9f308eb006836885dfa59d3bfa81c3b8df73fb7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-24f9-34c8-68cp/GHSA-24f9-34c8-68cp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0804.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0cb3007c-d398-4f31-a709-eb6e894cb439.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0362","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0803","title":"Sun Solaris CDE dtspcd 远程堆溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统的 CDE 子进程控制服务（dtspcd）在客户端连接处理例程（libDtSvc.so.1）中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119），未经身份认证的远程攻击者仅需向目标系统的 TCP 6112 端口发送特制超长数据包即可触发该溢出，进而执行任意系统命令，完全接管受影响主机。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5.1 至 9 等多个版本，CVSS v2 评分为满分 10.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），危害等级极其严重。攻击者无需事先获取任何用户凭据或系统权限，只要网络可达即可完成利用，实现任意代码执行、敏感信息窃取及持久化后门植入，并可作为进一步内网横向移动的跳板。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0803"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:59Z","remediation":"Sun Microsystems 官方安全通告 #00214 已发布补丁：Solaris 8 请安装补丁 108949-07（SPARC）或 108950-07（x86），Solaris 7 请安装 106934-04（SPARC）或 106935-04（x86），Solaris 2.6 请安装 105669-11（SPARC）或 105670-10（x86），Solaris 2.5.1 请安装 108363-02（SPARC）或 108364-02（x86）。HP-UX 平台请按版本安装对应补丁：10.10 安装 PHSS_25785，10.20 安装 PHSS_25786，10.24 安装 PHSS_26029，11.00 安装 PHSS_25787，11.04 安装 PHSS_26030，11.11 安装 PHSS_25788。IBM AIX 4.3 请安装 APAR IY25436，AIX 5.1 请安装 APAR IY25437。Compaq Tru64 UNIX 各版本需安装对应 ERP 补丁包。如暂无法立即打补丁，可编辑 /etc/inetd.conf 注释掉 dtspcd 服务行以禁用 dtspcd，同时在防火墙层面阻断外部对 6112/tcp 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ftp.support.compaq.com/patches/.new/html/SSRT-541.shtml","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/214","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-31.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-01.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/172583","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3517","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise101.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7396","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A70","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A74","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16323","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0803.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/793f2c91613b22189bf70b3322444954a50a3773/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0803.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0803","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/10de5f989525302a3452d86be5a85058aa88a086/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0803.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0803.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/40e5791b176b832cb09323d3962abe2fe3249e34/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-p2mw-q26f-vf87/GHSA-p2mw-q26f-vf87.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/569e64f21a36ad94da53d909e53f0d5114d5e7b7/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0360","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0360.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0800","title":"IRIX LPD 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.5.13f 及更早版本的 LPD（Line Printer Daemon）服务中，lpsched 进程在处理打印任务时未对用户输入进行充分的命令过滤，允许远程攻击者通过构造包含 shell 元字符（如 ;、|、` 等）的恶意打印请求，在目标系统上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响所有运行 IRIX 6.5.13f 或更早版本的 SGI IRIX 服务器，无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级极高。攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制系统，窃取敏感数据或 further 渗透内部网络。目前公开 ExploitDB 上已有编号 10033 的 PoC 可供验证，但官方修复方案需升级至 IRIX 6.5.14 或后续版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0800"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:58Z","remediation":"立即将 IRIX 操作系统升级至 6.5.24 或更高版本，该版本已修复 lpsched 中的 shell 元字符注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 lpd 服务（停止 lpsched 进程并注释 /etc/inetd.conf 中的 lpd 条目），同时在主机防火墙层面限制来自外部网络的 TCP 6101/515 端口访问，仅允许受信任的管理网络段连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.lsd-pl.net/files/get?IRIX/irx_lpsched2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/27566","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10033","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/700a72edb590fb1f0e5939ac4fed7cdb65918fb1/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0800.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0800","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/98c25b568de9f5663060bd4b7b00b621bdb6209c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0800.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58ee4ff7906d19f4609c9ca9aa75dfba481e1462/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0800.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5e38d33f9418cdc3d68c36334a911de898286f5e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-98r6-v62g-7mmx/GHSA-98r6-v62g-7mmx.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0800.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0360.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0329","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0329.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0859","title":"Red Hat Red Hat Linux 7.1 Korean 安装程序 不安全默认 Umask 漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 7.1 韩语版安装程序内核版本 2.4.3-12 存在默认 umask 配置错误，初始化程序的默认权限掩码被错误设置为 000，导致安装过程中创建的所有文件拥有全局可写权限。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过网络访问安装程序，在安装过程中向系统写入或修改任意文件，导致系统文件被篡改、权限提升及完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 7.1 韩语版安装程序，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需身份验证，主要影响系统完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0859"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Red Hat Linux 7.1 内核至 2.4.3-12 或更高版本，并应用官方安全更新 RHSA-2001-148；手动修改 Korean 安装程序中 init 的默认 umask 配置为 022，防止安装的文件被设置为全局可写；如无法立即升级，应禁止未授权用户在安装程序运行期间访问系统，安装完成后立即校验关键文件权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3725","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-148.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3527","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7549","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0859.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0859","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/51d462e668438eaead0d5fabdd60f13269763472/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0859.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0859.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p49-gvj5-jfx2/GHSA-5p49-gvj5-jfx2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0859.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f679f828-76ae-4a29-9ac7-4d7b8331e00c.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Dataset/Dataset/getCVELink/statistics/no_versionStartIncluding.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0329.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0327","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0852","title":"红帽 TUX HTTP 服务器 Host 头拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat TUX HTTP Server 2.1.0-2 存在拒绝服务漏洞，由于 TUX HTTP 服务器未正确处理过长的 Host 头部字段，远程未授权攻击者可发送超长的 Host 头部 HTTP 请求，触发缓冲区溢出或资源耗尽导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 中 TUX 2.1.0-2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，仅影响可用性。攻击者只需发送包含超长 Host 头部的 HTTP 请求即可触发拒绝服务，Red Hat 已将其评级为重要级别并发布补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0852"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06Z","remediation":"升级到 Red Hat Linux 7.3 或更高版本，其中包含已修复的 TUX HTTP Server 2.1.0-2 Host 头超长拒绝服务漏洞补丁（具体补丁信息请查阅 Red Hat 官方安全更新）。或者，可禁用 TUX HTTP 服务并改用 Apache 或 Nginx 等支持 Host 头长度限制的 Web 服务器。若无法立即升级，建议在防火墙或负载均衡层添加 HTTP Host 头长度检查（限制在 256 字节以内），并配置 Web 应用防火墙规则阻止超长 Host 头请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100498100112191&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=tux-list&m=100584714702328&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-142.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3506","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7464","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21141","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0852.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0852","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0852.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0852.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x995-3jq6-p477/GHSA-x995-3jq6-p477.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0852.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0852.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0325","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0325.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0851","title":"Linux 内核 syncookie 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.0、2.2 和 2.4 版本在启用 syncookies 功能时存在严重安全漏洞。syncookies 是 Linux 内核中用于保护 TCP 连接的保护机制，通过在连接建立时计算并验证 cookie 来防止 SYN 重放攻击。然而，该漏洞允许未经身份验证的远程攻击者通过暴力破解 cookie 值来欺骗 syncookies 验证机制，从而绕过防火墙规则。该漏洞在网络层面构成安全威胁，攻击者无需任何权限即可执行攻击，利用难度较低。攻击者通过不断尝试不同的 cookie 值，最终找到一个可以通过 syncookies 验证的伪造值，从而非法访问目标系统并获取其中存储的部分敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 2.0、2.2 和 2.4 版本，在系统启用 syncookies 时尤为突出。企业和组织应及时更新内核版本或禁用 syncookies 功能，以防止此安全漏洞被利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0851"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:05Z","remediation":"建议升级到包含 syncookies 安全修复的内核版本：Linux 2.5.48 或更高版本（如 2.6.2+ stable 版本），关闭 syncookies 或升级到支持安全 syncookie 实现的内核。可以关闭 syncookies（编辑 /etc/sysctl.conf，设置 net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies=0 并重启），或使用补丁后的系统，同时更新所有系统服务和完整性检查工具，如内核审计日志_analyzer 等工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000432","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-038.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-082.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1683.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_039_kernel2_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-142.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7461","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0851.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0851.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0851","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0851.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gfc3-m7qc-fc7m/GHSA-gfc3-m7qc-fc7m.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0851.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4d515335-ec97-4765-a0ad-ab83184ffa95.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0325.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0324","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0324.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0843","title":"Squid 代理服务器 2.4 FTP 代理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Squid 代理服务器 2.4 及早期版本的 FTP 代理功能存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可发送仅包含 MKD 命令的 FTP PUT 请求，触发 Squid 进程崩溃导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Squid 2.4 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需向开放 FTP 代理端口的 Squid 服务器发送特制的仅含 MKD 命令的 FTP PUT 请求即可触发崩溃，导致代理服务拒绝服务。Squid 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至 2.5 及以上版本或禁用 FTP 代理功能缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0843"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:04Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Squid 4.0 或更高版本以获取完整修复。如无法立即更新，可配置 `ftp_put_cmd_only_toplevel=off` 禁用敏感FTP命令，或通过防火墙限制FTP端口访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/conectiva/2001-q3/0020.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100109679010256&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-077","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-088.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_037_squid_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-113.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3354","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7157","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0843.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0843","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0843.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0843.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/squid_dos.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3jpq-2j9m-x6ww/GHSA-3jpq-2j9m-x6ww.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0843.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-077.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0843.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0324.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0322","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0322.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0835","title":"Bradford Barrett Webalizer 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Webalizer 2.01-06 版本（及可能的其他版本）存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过两种方式注入任意 HTML 标签：一是通过 HTTP Referer 头中嵌入的搜索关键词，二是通过反向 DNS 查询返回的主机名。该漏洞源于 Webalizer 在生成统计报告时未对 Referer 头中的关键词和反向 DNS 解析的主机名进行充分的输入验证与输出编码，导致恶意脚本可在查看统计报告的用户浏览器中执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，仅需诱导受害者访问包含恶意 Referer 的页面或控制反向 DNS 记录。漏洞影响 Webalizer 2.01-06 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者可利用该漏洞窃取用户会话、篡改页面内容或发起进一步攻击。建议升级至修复版本或禁用 Referer 统计功能、对反向 DNS 结果进行严格过滤转义。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0835"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:03Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Webalizer 2.9.1 或更高版本，这解决了 CVE-2001-0835 中提到的 XSS 漏洞。通过移除原生执行功能的全新版本，攻击者无法再通过搜索关键字或反向 DNS 查询注入恶意 HTML 代码。如果无法立即更新，建议禁用 Webalizer 服务或通过 WAF 规则过滤包含反斜杠或尖括号的 HTTP 请求和主机名，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2001-Nov/0001.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100394630702875&w=2","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1677.html","http://www.mrunix.net/webalizer/news.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-140.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-141.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3473","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7350","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7351","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0835.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0835.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0835","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0835.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/78b39fa4e3b98a034b1531a03afd2915b8497828/2001/CVE-2001-0835.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/webalizer.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-49cp-mq89-xq82/GHSA-49cp-mq89-xq82.json","https://github.com/syselement/tcm-sec-notes/blob/80d35f1b8a0848f3db433d6755c799ac51a884a7/peh/3-eth-hack/enum.md","https://github.com/TrshPuppy/obsidian-notes/blob/14e4da3df9ea0ce1a906c4956e5a0e6c75d73c26/PNPT/PEH/scanning-enumeration/kioptrix.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0322.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0322.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0320","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0320.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0834","title":"htDig htsearch CGI 任意文件读取与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ht://Dig 3.1.5 及更早版本中的 htsearch CGI 程序存在配置文件解析漏洞，该程序允许远程攻击者使用 -c 选项指定一个备用配置文件。攻击者可以通过向目标系统发送包含恶意配置文件的 HTTP 请求来触发该漏洞。攻击者可以利用这一漏洞通过指定大文件（如 /dev/zero）来消耗系统 CPU 资源，造成拒绝服务；或者通过上传一个包含目标文件路径的配置来读取目标系统中的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需身份验证即可通过网络远程利用，广泛影响基于 htdig 的搜索引擎系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0834"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:03Z","remediation":"建议升级 htdig 至 3.1.6 或更高版本（已修复 -c 参数配置文件注入漏洞）。若使用 Debian 系发行版，请升级至 Debian 安全公告 DSA-080 提供的修复版本（htdig 3.1.5-2.1 或更高）。若暂时无法升级，可通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 LimitExcept 或 ModSecurity 规则）禁止 htsearch CGI 接受 -c 参数，或在 Web 应用防火墙层面拦截包含 -c 参数的请求，同时限制 CGI 程序的文件读取权限（如设置 open_basedir 或 chroot 限制）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000429","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100260195401753&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?func=detail&aid=458013&group_id=4593&atid=104593","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-035.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-080","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-083.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_035_htdig_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-139.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3410","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7262","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7263","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0834.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0834","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0834.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0834.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v6hf-54vc-wr5c/GHSA-v6hf-54vc-wr5c.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-080.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0834.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/htsearch_config_switch.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-080.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0320.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0319","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0319.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0825","title":"xinetd xinetd 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"漏洞存在于xinetd版本2.1.8.8之前的内部字符串处理例程中。当攻击者向目标系统发送包含恶意长度参数的数据包时，该漏洞会导致整数溢出和长度检查失效，这是由于程序在处理用户输入的长度参数时缺乏有效验证。受影响的版本包括xinetd 2.1.8.8之前的版本，是广泛应用于Linux系统的网络服务守护程序，影响了多种Linux发行版上的服务器和工作站。该漏洞的攻击条件非常宽松，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，只需向目标系统发送包含恶意长度参数的数据包即可。这种缺陷导致攻击者可以通过缓冲区溢出攻击在目标系统上执行任意代码，完全破坏系统的机密性、完整性和可用性，严重威胁系统的安全运行。攻击者利用精心构造的恶意数据包来触发漏洞，该数据包通过禁用长度检查机制诱使xinetd调用其内部的字符串处理函数，最终导致内存缓冲区溢出。通过溢出攻击，攻击者可以在目标系统上注入任意代码并获得完全控制权限，使系统处于攻击者的掌控之下。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0825"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:01Z","remediation":"tags.<value>建议立即升级 xinetd 至 2.1.8.8 或更高版本（当前最新 2.3.15+），具体操作：1) Red Hat 系执行 `yum update xinetd`，Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get install --only-upgrade xinetd`；2) 参考 RHSA-2001-092、Conectiva CLA-2001:406、Immunix IMNX-2001-70-029-01 应用官方补丁；3) 无法立即升级时，用 iptables 限制 xinetd 监听端口仅允许受信 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的内置服务（如 telnet、ftp）；4) 检查 /etc/xinetd.conf 与 /etc/xinetd.d/ 下配置，确保 `only_from`、`no_access` 正确设置访问控制。该漏洞 CVSS 10.0，远程无需认证即可 RCE，务必优先修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000406","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-029-01","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-092.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2971","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6804","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0825.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0825","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0825.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0825.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w38q-jf8r-5q4w/GHSA-w38q-jf8r-5q4w.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0825.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-130.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0825.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--749bd0a1-2a49-4a0b-bc99-c591ec52151d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0319.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0318","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0819","title":"Linux fetchmail 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Linux fetchmail 5.8.6 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标邮件服务器发送一个包含超长 \"To:\" 字段的特制电子邮件头触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 fetchmail 全系早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可能造成敏感信息泄露、系统完整性破坏及服务可用性下降。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0819"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 fetchmail 至 5.8.6 或更高版本。若无法升级，可配置邮件过滤规则拦截含有超长 To: 字段的邮件头，或在边界邮件网关层限制邮件头字段长度不超过 4096 字节。对于使用 fetchmail 转发的内部网络，可暂时改用其他邮件转发代理（如 getmail）替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000403","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-025-01","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-022.1.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-060","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-063.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1451.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_026_fetchmail_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-103.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2877","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6704","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0819.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0819.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0819","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mj8x-p695-m8mc/GHSA-mj8x-p695-m8mc.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-060.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0819.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0819.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-060.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2986d1ae-55c9-4083-8a3d-9c6d6b139d22.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0318.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0317","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0317.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0816","title":"OpenSSH sftp-server 受限命令绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 2.9.9 之前版本存在安全绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于 sftp-server 在使用受限密钥对（restricted keypairs）时，未能正确执行 authorized_keys2 文件中配置的 command= 命令限制策略。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 sftp 命令绕过这些预设的命令执行约束，从而在目标系统上执行未授权操作。攻击条件为攻击者需拥有有效的 SSH 认证凭据（如已泄露的私钥），并连接启用了 authorized_keys2 命令限制的 OpenSSH 服务。此漏洞影响所有使用 OpenSSH 2.9.9 之前版本且配置了密钥命令限制的系统，可能导致权限提升和未授权命令执行。建议立即升级至 OpenSSH 2.9.9 或更高版本以修复此安全缺陷。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0816"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:00Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 2.9.9 或更高版本（当前主流版本为 9.x，建议至少升级至 OpenSSH 8.0p1 以上）。若系统为 RHEL/CentOS，可通过 `yum update openssh-server` 或 `dnf update openssh-server` 完成升级；Debian/Ubuntu 系统执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install openssh-server`。若暂时无法升级，可在 sshd_config 中禁用 sftp 子系统（注释掉 `Subsystem sftp /usr/libexec/openssh/sftp-server`），或改用 chroot 沙箱模式运行 sftp 并限制用户可执行的命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-09/0153.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000431","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-034-01","http://www.osvdb.org/5536","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-154.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7634","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0816.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0816","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0816.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0816.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6gpw-hxc4-7rm4/GHSA-6gpw-hxc4-7rm4.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0816.md","https://github.com/djc/oxish/blob/bf64cf02d5e31a17e708d69e2e0f66422499f851/openssh-vulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/openssh_adv_option.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0816.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0317.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0316","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0316.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0722","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5/6 Cookie泄露与修改漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 和 6.0 版本存在 Cookie 处理漏洞（又称\"First Cookie Handling Vulnerability\"）。该漏洞原理在于浏览器对 `about:` 协议 URL 中的 JavaScript 执行缺乏适当的安全隔离，攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 `about:` URL，绕过同源策略限制，从而读取或篡改用户的 Cookie 信息。攻击条件为：受害者使用受影响版本的 Internet Explorer 浏览器访问攻击者精心构造的恶意网页或链接，无需任何身份认证即可触发。利用方式是通过嵌入 `about:` URL 的 JavaScript 脚本访问其他域名的 Cookie 数据，导致敏感会话信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.4，影响 Internet Explorer 5.5 和 6.0 版本，属于中等危害等级的安全缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0722"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:50Z","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 SP1 或更高版本，该补丁已包含在 IE 6.0 SP1 安全更新中。如仍在使用 IE 5.5，建议直接迁移至 IE 6.0 SP1 或更新的现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Google Chrome、Mozilla Firefox）。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Internet 选项 → 安全 → Internet 区域中将 JavaScript 禁用或设置为\"提示\"，并启用\"检查网站服务器证书吊销\"及受限制的安全区域策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100527618108521&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-016.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1982","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/221612","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3513","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-055","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7486","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21144","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0722.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0722.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0722","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0722.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0722.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mm32-hgw5-cw3m/GHSA-mm32-hgw5-cw3m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0722.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0316.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0316.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0282","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0282.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0663","title":"Microsoft Windows NT/2000 Terminal Server RDP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT/2000 Terminal Server Service中存在漏洞，攻击者可远程发送无效的RDP（远程桌面协议）数据包，触发协议解析错误导致系统拒绝服务，影响 Windows NT/2000 操作系统。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程实施攻击，攻击复杂度低，可能导致系统服务不可用。漏洞影响Windows NT/2000 操作系统版本，CVSS评分5.3，危害等级中度。目前已知存在多个PoC工具，可用于测试该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0663"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:42Z","remediation":"紧急安装 Windows XP/2003 安全更新包，包括 KB825119 及后续 RDP 服务补丁，建议通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如需立即缓解，可通过防火墙禁用 3389 端口并启用网络级别 RDP 速率限制。配置策略：限制 RDP 连接数和会话超时时间至默认值 10 分钟。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3445","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7302","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21123","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0663.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0663.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0663","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0663.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0663.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9gm3-f4rm-2qfw/GHSA-9gm3-f4rm-2qfw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0663.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0282.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0423","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0423.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0941","title":"Oracle 8/9i DBSNMP 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle 8.0.6 至 9.0.1 版本中的 DBSNMP 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于未对 ORACLE_HOME 环境变量长度进行有效边界检查，本地攻击者可通过设置超长 ORACLE_HOME 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，导致以 DBSNMP 进程权限执行任意代码，可能造成敏感信息泄露、系统数据篡改或服务中断。攻击者需拥有本地操作系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0941"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:16Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle 数据库至 9.2.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 Oracle Critical Patch Update 中修复。如无法升级，移除 dbsnmp 程序的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s $ORACLE_HOME/bin/dbsnmp），并限制仅授权管理员可本地登录数据库服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100716693806967&w=2","http://otn.oracle.com/deploy/security/pdf/dbsmp_alert.pdf","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3138","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7643","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21044","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0941.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0941","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0941.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0941.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vcqj-cmgh-j5h7/GHSA-vcqj-cmgh-j5h7.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0941.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-0941.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0941.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercont